OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket's fresh plans for     
OL,4,Aformer council site                    
OL,6,FSupermarket chain Lidl has submitted   
OL,7,Ffresh plans for the site of former     
OL,8,Fcouncil offices after a proposal for a 
OL,9,Fnew store was refused earlier this     
OL,10,Fyear.                                  
OL,12,FThe latest application seeks permission
OL,13,Fto install security fencing around the 
OL,14,Fformer Buckinghamshire Council offices 
OL,15,Fsite in Amersham.                      
OL,17,FThis comes after the council rejected  
OL,18,Fplans for a supermarket on the former  
OL,19,FKing George V House site in May.       
