OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket's fresh plans for     
OL,4,Aformer council site                    
OL,6,FLidl wants the solid timber or steel   
OL,7,Fhoarding to remain in place for up to  
OL,8,Ffour years while longer-term           
OL,9,Fredevelopment proposals are worked on. 
OL,10,FThe fencing would be 2.4m (eight feet) 
OL,11,Fhigh.                                  
